 "transcript": [
  "[action] goes to see father",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"I should have been made an officer long ago and not my brother. He is still only a son and yet he is already setting up a great market, and I, your eldest son, have been made a rich officer among the rich men of the town. I do not envy him and I will not envy him, but I do not like it. It is a great shame, and I will not endure it.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung listens silently to his eldest son's words.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"And now I want to see my young brother and tell him that I would like to be a rich officer, and that I will not be a merchant.\"",
  "[silence] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "[action] (to the second son) goes to second son",
  "[action] (to the second son) Wang Lung sits on the bed and looks at his second son.",
  "[action] wants to leave",
  "[action] Wang Lung goes to the door.",
